                <h2>Personal</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="content-card">
                <h3>This Website</h3>
                <div class="meta">Full-Stack Development</div>
                <p>I coded this website from scratch. No CMS or other frameworks were used. I wrote this using plain old HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. So expect bugs and lots of jank. The code/commit history for this website can be found on my <a href="https://github.com/jethomps0n/My-Portfolio-Website" target="_blank">GitHub repo</a>.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="content-card">
                <h3>The Walking Dead Enthusiast</h3>
                <div class="meta">Fan & Analyst</div>
                <p>I am an avid The Walking Dead (TWD) fan. I am always down to discuss the show and its amazing themes and characters (especially Rick). If you want to hear more about my TWD obsession, view my blog posts about it <a href="/blog/tags/the-walking-dead/">here</a>.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

